            <ArticleTitle>Endovascular Treatment of Massive Axillary Artery Aneurysm for Palliation.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>188-190</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1177/1538574417691711</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Atherosclerotic axillary artery aneurysms are rare. We report a case of a ninety six year old female who presented with a pulsatile left breast mass causing her intractable pain. She was diagnosed with a massive axillary artery aneurysm which was treated with and endovascular aneurysm repair for palliation of her symptoms.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
